      "message": "Alternatively, you could completely remove TestTetheringEventListener, and just create a mock :\n\ncaptor \u003d ArgumentCaptor.forClass(Network.class)\nlistener1 \u003d Mockito.mock(ITetheringEventListener.Stub.class)\n\n\n// Then later :\nrunUsbTethering(upstreamState);\nverify(listener1, times(1)).onUpstreamChanged(captor.capture());\nassertEquals(upstreamState.network, captor.getValue())\nlistener1.reset();\n\nIn fact this is probably even simpler.",
